      "filename": "Army Corps Personnel Tour Passaic River Basin - 9-19-2012 (8116930213).jpg",
      "title": "File:Army Corps Personnel Tour Passaic River Basin - 9-19-2012 (8116930213).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/Army_Corps_Personnel_Tour_Passaic_River_Basin_-_9-19-2012_%288116930213%29.jpg",
